<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<paragraphs xml:id="para-pretext-inline" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Inline Elements and Tags</title>
  <p>
    Inline elements are used within paragraphs (<c>&lt;p&gt;</c>) to style text, emphasize notation, or attach metadata.
  </p>

  <table>
    <title>Common Inline Elements</title>
    <tabular bottom="minor" top="minor" left="minor" right="minor">
      <row header="yes">
        <cell>Element</cell>
        <cell>Usage</cell>
        <cell>Example Output</cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><c>&lt;m&gt;</c></cell>
        <cell>Inline Math (LaTeX)</cell>
        <cell><m>E = mc^2</m></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><c>&lt;tag&gt;</c></cell>
        <cell>Semantic Tags (Metadata Pill)</cell>
        <cell><tag>quantum mechanics</tag></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><c>&lt;c&gt;</c></cell>
        <cell>Inline Code / Verbatim</cell>
        <cell><c>git status</c></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><c>&lt;em&gt;</c></cell>
        <cell>Emphasis (Cooler Blue / Italic)</cell>
        <cell><em>Nuance</em></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><c>&lt;term&gt;</c></cell>
        <cell>Defined Term (Orange Gradient)</cell>
        <cell><term>Bivector</term></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><c>&lt;strong&gt;</c></cell>
        <cell>Strong Emphasis (Prominent Cyan)</cell>
        <cell><strong>Key Term</strong></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><c>&lt;alert&gt;</c></cell>
        <cell>Metadata labels (Glassmorphic Pill)</cell>
        <cell><alert>Warning!</alert></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><c>&lt;em class="alert"&gt;</c></cell>
        <cell>Critical Emphasis (Blue Gradient)</cell>
        <cell><em class="alert">Important!</em></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><c>&lt;xref&gt;</c></cell>
        <cell>Cross-reference</cell>
        <cell>See <xref ref="sec-pretext" /></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><c>&lt;url&gt;</c></cell>
        <cell>Hyperlink</cell>
        <cell><url href="https://pretextbook.org">PreTeXt Official Site</url></cell>
      </row>
    </tabular>
  </table>

  <p>
    <alert>Preview:</alert>
  </p>
  <p>
    In this passage we define a <term>topological manifold</term> with dimension <m>n</m>, noting that
    <strong>boundary conditions</strong> require careful analysis (see <alert>Key Principle</alert>). Metadata includes
    <tag>topology</tag> and <tag>geometry</tag>.
  </p>
  <program language="xml">
    <code>
      <![CDATA[
        <p>
          In this passage we define a <term>topological manifold</term>
          with dimension <m>n</m>, noting that <strong>boundary conditions</strong>
          require careful analysis (see <alert>Key Principle</alert>).
          Metadata includes <tag>topology</tag> and <tag>geometry</tag>.
        </p>
      ]]>
    </code>
  </program>
</paragraphs>
